    <selectionEntry id="f385-59b2-7bfa-2c8b-a53d8" name="Shrieker Cannon" hidden="false" collective="false" type="upgrade">
      <profiles />
      <rules>
        <rule id="8705-fc42-9bee-a399-a53d8" name="Bio-explosive" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>if a non-vehicle model is slain as a result of an attack with this special rule, centre the small blast marker over the model before removing the model as a casualty. Units suffer a number of Strength 5 AP4 hits equal to the number of models from that unit that are under the marker. These hits have the Ignores Cover special rule. </description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink id="c5e0-b876-3f06-a579-a53d8" hidden="false" targetId="e0d8-f075-772f-edae-a53d8" type="profile">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
