          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>Whenever a Voidweaver shoots, the shuriken cannon mounted on its aft can shoot at a different target to the Voidweaver's other weapons. The shuriken cannon mounted on the Voidweaver's aft can only target units that are in the Voidweaver's rear armour facing.</description>
